ss=\"hierarchy\">Date</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">1..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-date\">date</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck000.png)\" id=\"item.result-release-remark\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-text.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"text\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> result-release-remark</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">Remark, including whether a repeat sample is needed from the patient</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-text\">text</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.sex\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for sex </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://hl7.org/fhir/administrative-gender#male (\"Male\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://hl7.org/fhir/administrative-gender#female (\"Female\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.xpert-mtb-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for xpert-mtb-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">MTB not detected</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">MTB detected</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.xpert-rif-resistance-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for xpert-rif-resistance-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">RIF resistance detected</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">RIF resistance not detected</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">RIF resistance indeterminate</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.other-test-result-value\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for other-test-result-value </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Positive</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Negative</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Indeterminate</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.afb-specimen-number\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for afb-specimen-number </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">1</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">2</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.afb-smear-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for afb-smear-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Negative</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Scanty</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">1+</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">2+</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">3+</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.culture-purpose\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for culture-purpose </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Baseline culture</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Follow-up</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.solid-culture-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for solid-culture-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Negative</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Scanty</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">1+</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">2+</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">3+</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.liquid-culture-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for liquid-culture-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Negative</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Positive</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.lpa-dst-method\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for lpa-dst-method </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">LPA</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Solid culture DST</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Liquid culture DST</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.lpa-dst-specimen-number\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for lpa-dst-specimen-number </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">1</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">2</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.lpa-rifampicin-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for lpa-rifampicin-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Indeterminate</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.lpa-isoniazid-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for lpa-isoniazid-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Indeterminate</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.lpa-fluoroquinolone-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for lpa-fluoroquinolone-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Indeterminate</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.lpa-aminoglycoside-cyclic-peptide-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for lpa-aminoglycoside-cyclic-peptide-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Indeterminate</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.dst-isoniazid-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for dst-isoniazid-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.dst-rifampicin-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for dst-rifampicin-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.dst-ethambutol-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for dst-ethambutol-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.dst-pyrazinamide-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for dst-pyrazinamide-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.dst-kanamycin-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for dst-kanamycin-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.dst-amikacin-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for dst-amikacin-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resistant</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Susceptible</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Contaminated</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.dst-capreomycin-result\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for dst-capreomycin-result </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Resi